<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Walgreen Co downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Walgreen Co downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Everen Securities said on Tuesday it lowered its intermediate-term rating on Walgreen Co to a market perform from an outperform, due to valuation.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Kevin Silverman said he was maintaining his long-term outperform rating and estimates on Walgreen.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The stock has had a nice run and it is trading at nearly 28 times this year's earnings,&quot; he said. &quot;While the fundamentals are still very strong, I'd like to own it at a slightly lower valuation.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Walgreen shares were up 1/4 at 48-1/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
